{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 12, :comments ["<b>YHWH alone guided him.</b> As it says: כִּי אֶעֱשֶׂה כָלָה בְּכָל הַגּוֹיִם וְאוֹתְךָ לֹא אֶעֱשֶׂה כָלָה — 'For I will make a full end of all the nations, but you I will not make a full end' (Jeremiah 46:28)." "<b>And no alien god with Him.</b> As it says: כִּי אָז אֶהְפֹּךְ אֶל עַמִּים שָׂפָה בְרוּרָה לִקְרֹא כֻלָּם בְּשֵׁם ה׳ — 'For then I will turn to the peoples a pure language, that they may all call upon the name of YHWH' (Zephaniah 3:9); and as it says: אֱלֹהֵי כָל הָאָרֶץ יִקָּרֵא — 'the Elohim of all the earth shall He be called' (Isaiah 54:5)."], :book :deuteronomy, :voice :sforno, :lang :en, :chapter 32, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [{"versionTitle" "Sefaria community Hebrew (PD)", "language" "he"}], :timestamp "2026-07-22T16:23:00.203556648Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}